msgid "dailyBonus/description"
msgstr ""
"%(dailyBonus)s Bonus to Lucky Seals for being among the top "
"%(soloTopPlaces)s players in Solo battles or among the top "
"%(squadTopPlaces)s in Platoon battles. The bonus can be activated once a day"
" for each event vehicle."

